Package: veltos-fluent-icons
Architecture: all
Depends: breeze-icon-theme, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Fluent icon and cursor themes for VeltOS
 Clean, colourful icons in the style of Windows 11's Fluent design, by
 Vince Liuice. Installs the "Fluent", "Fluent-light" and "Fluent-dark"
 icon themes and the "Fluent-cursors"/"Fluent-dark-cursors" cursor themes.
 Icons that Fluent does not provide fall back to Breeze, so KDE
 applications never show missing icons.
 .
 Packaged by VeltOS from the pinned, checksum-verified upstream release
 recorded in upstream.json.
